  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Stand-in or traced",
      "items": [
        "Only the codex binary was a stand-in: the tag stand-in marks what it replays (reads 1 to 4, 6, 7 and the files of 9)",
        "The tag traced marks Frontier's own code seen in the trace: MCP server, spawn_agent, deliver, finish",
        "docs/HARNESSES.md names the files Codex reads, not their order: 1 to 4 follow the stand-in",
        "The stand-in's model call sends the prompt only, plus 'Answer with the single word OK.'"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Also read, not drawn",
      "items": [
        "prepare builds Server() for the tool table, so the launcher reads system.md, cloud.md, subagents.md and both roles at 1.20 s; that text is not in TOOLS.md",
        "The MCP server reads roles/*.md again at 12.96 s for the roles summary in subagents.md",
        "config/providers.toml also gives the agent files' models, the model and effort in argv, the variable names in config.toml and the blocked hosts in MISSION.md",
        "subject/subject.md is copied at 0.15 s and named in MISSION.md; the stand-in does not read it"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "Not used in this run",
      "items": [
        "install_skills: the mission has no [[skills]], nothing copied (12.44 s)",
        "NEXT_PROMPT opens sessions 2 and later; GOAL_CONDITION wraps a harness that has a goal command, and Codex has none",
        ".gitignore (__pycache__/, .env) is written for git, not for the AI",
        "The jury is a later command; it was not run here"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Commits of the workspace",
      "items": [
        "10 deliver: commit Delivery and tag delivery, 18.14 to 18.21 s",
        "The launcher's commit Session 1 at 18.26 s finds nothing new",
        "11 finish: COSTS.md (only its time changed) and delivery.json rewritten, commit Delivery, tag moved, 18.50 to 18.57 s"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
